      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U01_L03_Q12</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.AE.1; MLA.A2.AE.5</p><p>Which expression is fully factored?</p>]]></text>
