      <text>ALG2_U01_L03_Q20</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U01_L03_Q20</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.AE.1; MLA.A2.AE.5</p><p>Which statement best explains why (x - 4)(x + 4) is equivalent to x&#178; - 16?</p>]]></text>
